# ============================================================================
# Gemma Echo — Environment Configuration Template
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env` in the same directory and replace the placeholder
# values with your real keys. The `.env` file is git-ignored and must NEVER
# be committed.
#
# Gemma Echo runs FULLY OFFLINE without any of these keys, using only the
# local Gemma 4 Q4 GGUF + faster-whisper + XTTS-v2 stack. Each key below
# enables an OPTIONAL cloud accelerator or higher-quality online path.
# ============================================================================

# ── Translation (Required for online mode) ─────────────────────────────────
# Used by the Gemma 4 26B (`gemma-4-26b-a4b-it`) primary path and the
# Gemini 2.5 Flash speed-fallback. Free tier available at:
#   https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here

# ── Online TTS (Optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# High-quality cloud voice synthesis. Free tier: ~10k characters/month.
# Without this key the app falls back to local XTTS-v2.
#   https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_key_here

# ── Cloud Speech-to-Text Accelerators (Optional) ───────────────────────────
# These are pure speech-to-text accelerators for low-VRAM machines that cannot
# run faster-whisper locally. They are NOT used for translation.
#
# Groq hosts OpenAI's Whisper-large-v3 on its LPU hardware (free tier):
#   https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=your_key_here